    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nIdeally positioned at the entrance to the ever-popular Spencer Manor development, No. 53 is an attractive two-bedroom, two-bathroom first-floor apartment offering comfortable living in a highly convenient Castlebar location. Within minutes' walk of the Town Centre, Mayo University Hospital and the Atlantic Technological University, this appealing property enjoys easy access to the excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants and amenities the town has to offer.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully arranged, with a welcoming entrance hallway leading to an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. This sociable space provides ample room for everyday living and entertaining, while access to a private balcony adds a pleasant outdoor dimension to the apartment. The fitted cherry kitchen offers a warm, classic finish, complemented by the quality materials found throughout the home.\n\nBoth bedrooms are generously proportioned doubles and benefit from fitted wardrobes, providing practical storage. The main bedroom enjoys its own en-suite shower room, while a separate family bathroom serves the second bedroom and visitors. A hot press completes the accommodation.\n\nSolid oak flooring and porcelain tiling enhance the interior, creating a polished finish that combines warmth with everyday practicality. Access is available by both lift and stairwell, and the apartment also benefits from its own designated parking space.\n\nCombining a well-appointed interior with two double bedrooms, balcony space and an excellent location, No. 53 Spencer Manor will appeal to first-time buyers, those seeking to downsize and investors looking for a conveniently situated property in one of Castlebar's most popular residential developments."
      },
